OL,3,GNEWSAFraud victim tricked into handing
OL,4,Acash to bogus cops
OL,5,
OL,6,FA CCTV clue has been released as part
OL,7,Fof an investigation into a courier
OL,8,Ffraud scam in Leicestershire.
OL,10,FPolice said earlier this year a woman
OL,11,Fin the north west of the county was
OL,12,Ftricked into withdrawing money and
OL,13,Fhanding it over.
OL,15,FBetween 25 March and 7 April, the
OL,16,Fvictim was contacted by a man claiming
OL,17,Fto be a police officer who said her
OL,18,Faccount had been used to try to buy a
OL,19,Flaptop and that she would need to
OL,20,Fwithdraw money and hand it to the force
OL,21,Ffor safe-keeping. A woman then visited
OL,22,Fher address to collect the money.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
